## ☁️ Infrastructure as Code (IaC)

Infrastructure as Code means managing infrastructure using code instead of manual setup.

### 🚀 Benefits

* Faster deployment
* Automation
* Reusable templates
* Easy management

---

## ⚙️ IaC Tools

### 1️⃣ Terraform

* Multi-cloud IaC tool
* Works with AWS, Azure, GCP

### 2️⃣ AWS CloudFormation

* AWS-native IaC service

---

## 🏗️ Resources You Can Create Using IaC

* EC2 (Virtual Machines)
* VPC (Networking)
* S3 (Storage)
* RDS (Databases)
* Lambda (Serverless Functions)

