## 📦 AWS SDK (Software Development Kit)

AWS SDK allows applications to interact with AWS services programmatically.

### 💻 Supported Languages:

* Python
* Java
* Node.js
* Go
* .NET

### 🚀 Real Use Cases:

* Upload files to S3
* Trigger Lambda functions
* Manage EC2 instances
* Connect to databases

